--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- NAME: Career Change Workshop Sign-up
-- Since 2026-10-01 this is the RECORDING page for the live workshop "Thinking Clearly
-- About Career Change" (held 2026-09-30, Clearer Thinking with Angel Au of Overcome).
-- The sign-up form, confirmation email and Google Sheet service were retired after the
-- session; the full sign-up version is in git history of the growth-advisor repo
-- (guidedtrack/Career Change Workshop Sign-up.gt, before 2026-10-01).
-- ?src= from the run URL is still saved, so you can see which channel sent each visit.
--
-- GOTCHAS (see the old version for more): <img> is stripped from *html, so the logo is
-- a CSS background image; {variable} is not interpolated inside <style>.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- SETTINGS (edit these) ---------------------------------------------------------
>> workshopTitle = "Thinking Clearly About Career Change"
>> workshopSubtitle = "What the evidence says, and what it can't tell you"
>> recordingUrl = "https://youtu.be/nlGCK76aEKk"
>> overcomeUrl = "https://www.overcome.org.uk/change-your-career?utm_source=CTCareer"
>> facilitatorName = "Angel Au"
>> facilitatorLine = "Co-Founder of Overcome and EMCC-accredited coach"
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Tracking parameter from the run URL (?src=newsletter). Empty when absent.
*if: not src
	>> src = ""

*settings
	*menu: no
	*back: no

*html
	<style>
		.program_container .main { max-width: 640px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
		@media (max-width: 767px) { .program_container .main { padding-top: 64px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; } }
		.program_container p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 14px 0; }
		.program_container a { color: #0A6FD6; text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }
		.program_container .btn { background-color: #0885F8; border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
		.program_container .btn:hover, .program_container .btn:focus { background-color: #0A6FD6; border: none; color: #fff; }
		.program_container .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #0A6FD6; outline-offset: 3px; }
		@media (min-width: 600px) { .program_container .btn.btn-block { display: inline-block; width: auto; min-width: 300px; } }
		.program_container .ct-brandrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-logo { display: inline-block; width: 30px; height: 30px; background-image: url("https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,onerror=redirect/uploads/publication/logo/d0ed5a5f-0bca-4054-ab2c-73fd51707f71/Logo-01.png"); background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; }
		.program_container .ct-wordmark { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a1a; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
		.program_container:has(#ct-logo) .ct-brandrow { display: none; }
		.program_container h1.ct-title { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 30px !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container h2.ct-h2 { color: #1a1a1a !important; font-size: 21px !important; line-height: 1.3 !important; font-weight: 700 !important; margin: 40px 0 10px 0 !important; }
		.program_container p.ct-sub { color: #5b6472; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 0 0 22px 0; }
		.program_container p.ct-fine, .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-fine { color: #6b7380; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-style: normal; margin: 10px 0 0 0; }
		.program_container .ct-facts { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0 !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #f4f8fd !important; padding: 16px 20px !important; margin: 0 0 24px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p { margin: 3px 0; font-size: 16px; }
		.program_container .ct-facts b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2a2a; margin-bottom: 10px; }
		.program_container ul.ct-list li b { color: #1a1a1a; }
		@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container h1.ct-title { font-size: 28px !important; } .program_container p.ct-sub { font-size: 18px; } }
		
		.program_container p.ct-eyebrow { color: #0A6FD6; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
		.program_container h1.ct-title.ct-hero { font-size: 34px !important; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p.ct-skip { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
		.program_container .ct-facts p.ct-skip a { display: inline-block; padding: 6px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio { border: 1px solid #dfe6f0 !important; border-radius: 10px !important; box-shadow: none !important; background: #ffffff !important; padding: 20px 22px !important; margin: 10px 0 28px 0 !important; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
		.program_container .ct-bio-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 112px 1fr; column-gap: 20px; row-gap: 0; align-items: center; }
		.program_container .ct-avatar { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; width: 112px; height: 140px; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #e9eef5; background-image: url("https://programs.clearerthinking.org/career-workshop/angel-au.jpg"); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: auto 150%; background-position: 46% 50%; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-name { grid-column: 2; align-self: end; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-role { grid-column: 2; align-self: start; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #5b6472; margin: 0; }
		.program_container .ct-bio p.ct-bio-para { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 16px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.6; }
		@media (max-width: 480px) { .program_container .ct-bio-row { grid-template-columns: 88px 1fr; column-gap: 16px; } .program_container .ct-avatar { width: 88px; height: 110px; border-radius: 10px; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-name { font-size: 19px; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-role { font-size: 14px; } .program_container .ct-bio p.ct-bio-para { margin-top: 14px; } }
		.program_container .ct-video { margin: 0 0 18px 0; }
		.program_container a.ct-cta { display: inline-block; background-color: #0885F8; color: #fff !important; text-decoration: none !important; border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px 26px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 4px 0 8px 0; }
		.program_container a.ct-cta:hover, .program_container a.ct-cta:focus { background-color: #0A6FD6; }
		.program_container a.ct-cta-alt { background-color: #ffffff; color: #0A6FD6 !important; border: 2px solid #0885F8; }
		.program_container a.ct-cta-alt:hover, .program_container a.ct-cta-alt:focus { background-color: #f4f8fd; }
	</style>

*html
	<div class="ct-brandrow"><span class="ct-logo"></span><span class="ct-wordmark">Clearer Thinking</span></div>
	<p class="ct-eyebrow">Workshop recording, with Overcome</p>
	<h1 class="ct-title ct-hero">{workshopTitle}</h1>
	<p class="ct-sub">{workshopSubtitle}</p>

*video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlGCK76aEKk

*html
	<p><a class="ct-cta" href="{recordingUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube</a></p>
	<p>The live workshop took place on September 30. The full recording is above. It covers what the research on career change shows, where that research runs out, and how to work through the obstacles readers told us about.</p>
	<h2 class="ct-h2">What it covers</h2>
	<ul class="ct-list">
		<li>What the evidence says about finding a career that fits.</li>
		<li>What predicts a career change going well.</li>
		<li>How to navigate common obstacles such as too many plausible options, transition costs, and a job market unsettled by AI.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2 class="ct-h2">Who led it</h2>

*component
	*classes: ct-bio
	*html
		<div class="ct-bio-row">
			<span class="ct-avatar" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Angel Au"></span>
			<p class="ct-name"><b>{facilitatorName}</b></p>
			<p class="ct-role">{facilitatorLine}</p>
			<p class="ct-bio-para">Angel Au is Co-Founder of Overcome, a UK-registered mental health charity that has provided free one-to-one coaching to 4,000+ people since 2023. She holds an MSci in Psychology from UCL, and is an incoming MPhil/PhD student at UCL's Division of Psychiatry. As an EMCC-accredited coach, she has delivered 120+ hours of one-to-one coaching to psychology graduates and career changers navigating postgraduate applications and early-career psychology roles. For this workshop, she compiled what the research does and doesn't say about career decisions.</p>
		</div>

*component
	*classes: ct-facts
	*html
		<h2 class="ct-h2" style="margin-top: 4px !important;">Considering a move into mental health work?</h2>
		<p>Overcome's self-paced, fully remote course trains career changers to work as mental health coaches, without going back to university. The training is accredited by the Personalised Care Institute, the standard NHS England uses for personalised care training.</p>
		<p><a class="ct-cta ct-cta-alt" href="{overcomeUrl}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Overcome's course</a></p>

*html
	<p class="ct-fine">Clearer Thinking is a not-for-profit project. The workshop recording is free to watch and share.</p>
